hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"879","Abu Yazid or Ma'n ibn Yazid reported that the Prophet"
"880","'A'isha said"
"881","Anas ibn Malik"
"882","Nafi' said"
"883","'Abdu'r-Rahman ibn 'Ajlan said"
"884","'A'isha"
"885","Anas ibn Malik said"
"886","'Umar said"
"887","Mutarrif ibn 'Imran ibn ash-Shakhir said"
"888","'Amr ibn al-'As said"
"889","'A'isha said"
"890","Az-Zuhri reported that a man from Bali said"
"891","Muhammad ibn al-Hanafiyya said"
